------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Redistributed third-party components and their licenses are listed in
licenses/THIRD-PARTY.md, generated as part of the release process.

The interface's typeface is Noto Serif Regular (version 1.07), Copyright 2012
Google Inc., licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1. It is
carried inside GK3Reborn.Engine as an embedded resource at
src/GK3Reborn.Engine/Assets/Fonts/NotoSerif-Regular.ttf, and its licence is
included in that file's own name table. The OFL permits this redistribution;
the font is not sold on its own and its name is not used to promote anything.
See https://scripts.sil.org/OFL. A .ttf or .otf placed in the content
workspace's enhanced/fonts directory is used in preference to it, which is how
the typeface is changed without rebuilding.

None of GK3's own fonts are redistributed. They are read from the player's
installation like every other original asset, and are still what the interface
falls back to when no outline font can be read.

FFmpeg is a runtime dependency rather than a redistributed component: the
cutscenes are decoded through FFMediaToolkit (MIT) over FFmpeg's own shared
libraries, which are located at run time from libs/<rid> or from the system
and are not part of this source tree. A build of FFmpeg placed there must be
an LGPL one, and its own licence and source-offer obligations travel with it
rather than with this project. A machine with no FFmpeg runs the game without
its cutscenes.
